# Prettier owns the TS/TSX/JSON of the JS workspaces + root tooling config only.
# Everything else is hand-authored, generated, or owned by another toolchain.

# Dependencies / build output
node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.next/
**/coverage/
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Documentation & governance prose (hand-formatted; the doc-consistency lint owns these)
docs/
**/*.md
PROJECT_MEMORY.md
PHASE-P0.1-REPORT.md
LICENSE

# Other toolchains
infrastructure/
scripts/
tests/
.github/
services/platform-hello/        # Go service + Helm templates (not prettier-owned)
**/*.go
**/go.mod
**/go.sum
**/*.tf
**/*.tfvars
**/*.rego
# YAML (Helm/k8s/CI/compose) uses its own conventions; templates aren't valid YAML for prettier
**/*.yaml
**/*.yml

# Local artifacts
stage-a-evidence.txt
*.msi
